### Data Sources

**Educational Attainment Data:**
- American Community Survey (ACS) 5-year estimates
- U.S. Census Bureau
- https://www.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/
- 2017-2021 data, county-level

**Election Results:**
- 2020 Presidential Election by county
- Federal Election Commission
- https://www.fec.gov/
- Democratic vote share, county-level

**Demographic Variables:**
- American Community Survey (2017-2021)
- % veteran population
- % population over 65
- % White population
- % charitable donors

**Geographic Data:**
- U.S. Census Bureau Tiger/Line Files
- County boundaries and shapefile boundaries

